[{"id":3102349488,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc646hiw","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?u=24618295fece29a0bf5c850faf2555985232f5f2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","login":"aaronfranke","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke"},"body":"Does this actually produce the correct behavior? The local and global transforms may not be the same when using an external skeleton. I'm wondering if it would be better to instead do nothing in this case, rather than use `set_transform` to set a potentially wrong transform. Something like this, with a comment explaining what's going on:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (sk) {\r\n\tif (!override_pose) {\r\n\t\tif (use_external_skeleton) {\r\n\t\t\tif (sk->is_inside_tree()) {\r\n\t\t\t\tset_global_transform(sk->get_global_transform() * sk->get_bone_global_pose(bone_idx));\r\n\t\t\t\t// Else, do nothing, the transform will be set when the skeleton enters the tree:\r\n\t\t\t\t// Skeleton3D::_notification(NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE) -> calls Skeleton3D::_notification(NOTIFICATION_UPDATE_SKELETON)\r\n\t\t\t\t// -> emits skeleton_updated signal -> connected to BoneAttachment3D::on_skeleton_update()\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\tset_transform(sk->get_bone_global_pose(bone_idx));\r\n\t\t}\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109444#pullrequestreview-3102349488","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109444","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-09T00:34:22Z"},{"id":3103229808,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6494dw","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"b9878b3e097d013276f20498f5e7e216b3a69495","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?u=24618295fece29a0bf5c850faf2555985232f5f2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","login":"aaronfranke","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke"},"body":"Needs approval from Tokage before merge but makes sense to me.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109444#pullrequestreview-3103229808","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109444","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-09T19:50:19Z"},{"id":3103485359,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc64-22v","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"b9878b3e097d013276f20498f5e7e216b3a69495","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"I double checked and the comment is correct. So this should be good to go. The proper way of handling this situation is to only update the transform when in the tree and to call the setter again once the node is added to the tree","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109444#pullrequestreview-3103485359","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109444","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-10T06:37:19Z"},{"id":3103508110,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc64-8aO","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"b9878b3e097d013276f20498f5e7e216b3a69495","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109444#pullrequestreview-3103508110","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109444","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-10T07:51:15Z"}]